  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">University Scholarship Program (long term)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUMMARY. 125 young people from all 534 communities in the provinces of Cotopaxi, Chimborazo, Bolivar, Guayas, Los R&#xed;os, Manab&#xed;, Santa Elena, Loja and Pichincha will be identified to enrol the University Scholarship program. They will be granted a scholarship and provided with life skills training, coaching and mentoring, in order to successfully obtain their University degree and increase their opportunity to a decent job.</narrative>
  </description>
